# NOTE: 8ai.ac → ai.vocino.com 301 is handled at Cloudflare edge (Redirect Rules)
# GitHub Pages ignores this file — kept for documentation only.
# Active rule in Cloudflare (8ai.ac zone):
#   When: (http.host eq "8ai.ac" or http.host eq "www.8ai.ac")
#   Then: 301 concat("https://ai.vocino.com", http.request.uri.path) + Preserve query string
# This preserves path + query for all URLs including /sitemap.xml and /robots.txt.
# Cloudflare `Always Use HTTPS` also handles http → https.
#
# The following were legacy Cloudflare Pages / Netlify syntax — inert on GH Pages:
# https://8ai.ac/* https://ai.vocino.com/:splat 301
# http://8ai.ac/* https://ai.vocino.com/:splat 301
# /category/:slug.html /category/:slug/ 301
# /tools/*  /tools/:splat/  301
